    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100900309/1009003090010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お疲れ、果穂\r\n公開オーディション、よく頑張ったな！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003090020,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたし、がんばれてましたか……？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900309/1009003090020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん、十分すぎるくらいだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003090030,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "そっ……かぁ……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900309/1009003090030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "いつもよりスケジュール詰めてたのにさ……\r\n結構きつかったろ……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003090040,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへっ、ちょっとだけ……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900309/1009003090040"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003090050,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "でも、バラエティのお仕事、\r\nどれもスッゴく楽しかったです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900309/1009003090050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……よかった\r\n評判良かったし、こっちの仕事を増やしてもいいかもな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "『G.R.A.D.』、受けてみてどうだった？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003090060,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "んー……\r\nオーディションのこととは、ちょっとちがうんですけど……",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900309/1009003090060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003090070,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "オーディションのために、自己PRしてて、\r\nわかったことがたくさんありました！",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900309/1009003090070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003090080,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたし、まだまだできないことがいっぱいあるんだって！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900309/1009003090080"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003090090,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "PRをしている時、色んな人が\r\n『しっかりしてるね』ってほめてくれました",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900309/1009003090090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003090100,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "司会者さんとか、共演者の方とか……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900309/1009003090100"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003090110,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "スッゴくうれしかったです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900309/1009003090110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003090120,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "でも──",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900309/1009003090120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003090130,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "ほめてもらったことは、全部放クラのみなさんが\r\n教えてくれたことなんですっ！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900309/1009003090130"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003090140,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "だから、本当は、\r\nほめてもらうのはあたしじゃなくて……──！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900309/1009003090140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でもな、やっぱり果穂も褒められるべきだって、俺は思うぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003090150,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900309/1009003090150"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    }
  },
  {
    "bg": "00000",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（……果穂は、メンバーのおかげだって思ってるけど）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（写真も、挨拶も……そういうみんなの『魅力』を\r\n引き出しているのは、果穂自身なんだって──）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（きっと全然自覚ないんだろうなぁ……\r\nそれが、果穂のすごいところなんだけどさ）",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "bg": "00070",
    "bgEffect": "fade",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "教えたのは放クラのみんなだけど、\r\nそれを、必要な時にちゃんとできたのは果穂の力だ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だから、『放クラのみなさん』じゃなくて\r\n『あたしたちみんな』だな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003090160,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたしたち……！\r\n──あっ！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/100900309/1009003090160"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003090170,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "そしたら、あたしたちだけじゃなくて、\r\nあたしたちと、プロデューサーさんです！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900309/1009003090170"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003090180,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あの時、プロデューサーさんが\r\n『あたしのためになる』って言ってくれたから……",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900309/1009003090180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003090190,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "『G.R.A.D.』、出ようって\r\nやってみようって決めたんです！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900309/1009003090190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺もか……！\r\nそれは、嬉しいなぁ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003090200,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "えへへっ",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900309/1009003090200"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003090210,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "あたし、これからもみなさんに\r\n色んなことを教わると思います！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900309/1009003090210"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003090220,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "みなさんみたいになるには、まだまだだけど……",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900309/1009003090220"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003090230,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "でも、あたしにできることもあるって、わかりました！",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kaho",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/100900309/1009003090230"
  },
  {
    "id": 1009003090240,
    "speaker": "果穂",
    "text": "だから、あたしにできることで、\r\n放クラのみなさんのために、これからもがんばるんです！",
